+## What Premise does
 
-```powershell
-claude mcp add premise -- "S:/StudyResource/TechBoooo/Hackathons/weMakeDevs-FolkoreDB/Premise/.venv/Scripts/python.exe" -m premise.cli --host 127.0.0.1 --port 6379 --graph premise_kestrel mcp
